# -- CURSE 31: Helena builds are LOCAL/PRIVATE; git keeps only the MIRROR --------
# The pattern (level 12, snappy pushes): the heavy build DATA never enters git.
# It lives on your disk (private). Git tracks only the tiny MIRROR -- MANIFEST.json
# + build_card.json per version -- so another mage sees the exact steps and can
# regenerate the whole net locally. "Pay thea Heleni in compute."
#   novice:  py -3 pipe.py --max 9 --k 4 --bits 10101      (rebuild from scratch)
#   advanced: py -3 redundancy.py repair builds/vNNN/net    (rebuild csv from bin+zip)
builder/helena_net/builds/**
# ...but KEEP the mirror (the steps, not the payload).
# Re-include every DIRECTORY so git can descend, then re-include only the mirror files:
!builder/helena_net/builds/**/
!builder/helena_net/builds/**/MANIFEST.json
!builder/helena_net/builds/**/build_card.json
!builder/helena_net/builds/**/BROKEN.txt

